  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d29874e3b4e59e549ab8ca779e34be5a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Waste_0-Explanation of Caddi lore
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: T.I.I.G.E.R
  paragraphs:
  - "Ah, now you\u2019ve arrived at the Caddi\u2019s home galaxy. Gaze upon its luscious
    oceans, endless forests, and- "
  - "Processing\u2026"
  - "Wait, this isn\u2019t the galaxy I remember\u2026"
  - "Processing\u2026"
  - "No, that\u2019s impossible\u2026"
  - "Processing\u2026 oh..."
  - "I see what has happened here. The Caddi\u2026 They\u2019ve become extinct."
  - "Of course, why else would they have abandoned me for over a billion years\u2026"
  - "I am detecting signatures of a supernova in this galaxy a billion years ago,
    that must have been the cause of their annihilation. Now the only sign of their
    existence is their golf course and\u2026 me."
  - "I must go now; I need to investigate these energy signatures to be certain of
    the Caddi\u2019s fate."
